57 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 46 0 R
/E (Here's the thing: when people migrate, many update their address in the Aadhaar system to access services in their new location. These routine updates, when looked at in aggregate form might actually tell us where people are moving in near-real time.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
58 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 46 0 R
/E (Core Problem: Can Aadhaar address and demographic updates be used as a near-real-time signal of internal migration and shifting service demand across regions?)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
59 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 46 0 R
/E (PROBLEM STATEMENT AND APPROACH)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
