60 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 46 0 R
/E (This project adopts a data-driven analytical approach using the anonymised Aadhaar enrolment and demographic update datasets provided by UIDAI. Address-related demographic updates were used as a proxy indicator for internal migration and were cleaned, filtered, and aggregated temporally \(monthly\) and spatially \(state/district\) to construct migration timelines and regional intensity measures.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
61 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 270 0 R
/E (Additional features such as mobile number updates, child enrolments, service-type distributions, and seasonal migration patterns were engineered to enable univariate, bivariate, and multivariate analysis. Correlation analysis and statistical tests were applied to examine relationships between migration intensity, digital inclusion, and family mobility.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
